{"id":"wb-6-151","name":"山阳故城","retrievedAt":"2026-11-09T06:20:01+00:00","status":"ready","title":"山阳故城 (焦作市)","text":"山阳故城是位于中华人民共和国河南省焦作市山阳区新城街道墙南村的古城遗址，为汉代山阳县的县治所在地，现存遗迹以汉代遗存为主。城址占地约300万平方米，保留有夯土城墙，周围分布着与古城相关的汉代墓群。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%B1%B1%E9%98%B3%E6%95%85%E5%9F%8E_(%E7%84%A6%E4%BD%9C%E5%B8%82)","revisionId":95332127,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=95332127","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/aa3e58162ee4731ddb1fe0b9.jpg","title":"20250719 Site of Shanyang City 01.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20250719_Site_of_Shanyang_City_01.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/11/20250719_Site_of_Shanyang_City_01.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​焦作 山阳故城","width":320,"height":213,"matchEvidence":"名称及地点核对一致"}}